  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Restore the Glass</b><p></p>\n<p>You arrive in the lands of Glimmith, a kingdom above the clouds. Your newest benefactor has hired you, a famed stained glass artisan, to help him restore the area to its former glory. However, he has given you an unusual stipulation: use whatever colors you please, so long as you follow the rules!</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Explore the Kingdom – A cozy hamlet, an enchanted forest, and a forlorn castle await. Keep your eyes open for hidden paths and secret puzzles nestled away for the most observant players.\n</li><li>Enjoy Handcrafted Quality – <b>Curated, Not Generated</b>: Experience a journey handcrafted by human puzzle designers. <b>Variety</b>: Discover over 20 unique rule types while you color, cut, and join beautiful stained glass artworks. <b>Mastery</b>: Optional finale puzzles put experts to the test. These challenges require you to use every trick you’ve learned to pass.\n</li><li>Create Your Own Puzzles – Create your own puzzles and share them with the community using the in-game level editor.\n</li></ul>\n",
